---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-10 bg-slate-950 text-white/75">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-[min(calc(100%-2rem),1120px)] justify-between gap-8 py-12 max-md:flex-col">
    <div>
      <strong class="font-['Baloo_2'] text-2xl text-white">
        Alizés Adventure
      </strong>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
        Excursion dans la mangrove au départ de Sainte-Rose, Guadeloupe.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="grid gap-2">
      <a class="font-extrabold text-white no-underline hover:text-yellow-300" href="/votre-excursion">
        Votre excursion
      </a>
      <a class="font-extrabold text-white no-underline hover:text-yellow-300" href="/charte-qualite">
        Charte qualité
      </a>
      <a class="font-extrabold text-white no-underline hover:text-yellow-300" href="/tarifs-reservation">
        Tarifs
      </a>
      <a class="font-extrabold text-white no-underline hover:text-yellow-300" href="/contact">
        Contact
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-5 text-center text-sm">
    <div class="mx-auto flex w-[min(calc(100%-2rem),1120px)] flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
      <span>© {year} Alizés Adventure. Tous droits réservés.</span>

      <a class="font-bold text-white no-underline hover:text-yellow-300" href="/mentions-legales">
        Mentions légales
      </a>

      <span class="text-white/25">•</span>

      <a class="font-bold text-white no-underline hover:text-yellow-300" href="/politique-confidentialite">
        Politique de confidentialité
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>